@k.words.black.noun.1 k.words.sense word=black pos=noun n=1 gloss="the quality or state of the achromatic color of least lightness (bearing the least resemblance to white)" synonym=blackness synonym=inkiness is_a="achromatic color" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
